{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"options\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": \"他心里生出一丝不安。前面的亲近已真切地安顿过他，因此他开始在意，自己还能不能继续安心地靠近。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"亲近已经成为他会依靠的安稳来源。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 8,\n      \"why\": \"前文明确写到亲近已带给他真实的安稳，因此将此刻的不安理解为依靠形成后的顾虑，因果依据充分。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选16\",\n        \"候选14\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": \"他有些不自在，平日习惯的克制开始显得拘束。前面的亲近让他投入更深，也让他更难把对理解的渴望照旧收好。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"越深入投入亲近，他越难照旧收起对理解的需要。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 7,\n      \"why\": \"他原本习惯收起自己的需要，而更深的投入使这种克制变得局促，因果连贯，但把此刻的不安解释为自我克制的冲突仍有一定推断。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选3\",\n        \"候选7\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ff412754-84f5-4586-a978-13b7e651ffb6", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T020152223889Z", "elapsed_seconds": 66.875, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T02:02:59.105745+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0819000c41d432417a0d4653f2a6bd37d698a3abc44eb80b888285420722814d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cec